<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#fbfdff"><title>即将离开 {{.Site}}</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#fbfdff;--fg:#172033;--muted:#64748b;--line:#e2e8f0;--primary:#2563eb}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:14px/1.6 system-ui,-apple-system,"PingFang SC",sans-serif;min-height:100svh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:20px}
main{width:100%;max-width:480px}
h1{font-size:20px;line-height:1.4;margin:16px 0 8px}
p{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0}
.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none}
.brand span{color:var(--fg)}
.brand img{display:block;max-width:160px;height:32px;object-fit:contain}
.destination{margin-top:14px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.host{font-weight:600}
.url{margin-top:2px;font-size:13px}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}
nav a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:32px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line)}
nav a.continue{background:var(--primary);color:white;border-color:var(--primary)}
a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #93c5fd;outline-offset:3px}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#101010;--fg:#eee;--muted:#aaa;--line:#333;--primary:#60a5fa}nav a.continue{color:#101010}}
</style></head>
<body><main>
<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="{{.Site}}">
{{if and (eq .BrandType "image") .BrandImage}}<img src="{{.BrandImage}}" alt="{{.Site}}">
{{else if eq .BrandType "text"}}{{if .BrandText}}{{.BrandText}}{{else}}{{.Site}}{{end}}
{{else}}Goose<span>Forum</span>{{end}}
</a>
<h1>即将前往外部网站</h1>
<p>该链接由用户发布，外部网站的内容与安全性不由本站保证。请确认地址后继续。</p>
<div class="destination"><div class="host">{{.Host}}</div><p class="url">{{.URL}}</p></div>
<nav><a href="/">返回首页</a><a class="continue" href="{{.URL}}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">继续访问</a></nav>
</main></body></html>
